        "Advisory mode retired: grooming either files gated drafts (switch on, within "
            + "the gates and the shared ceiling) or doesn't (switch off), so there is no "
            + "inbox to list or act on. The route stays registered to answer 410 with a "
            + "note rather than vanishing into a 404 a driver would read as its own typo."
    }

